# CODEOWNERS — auto-request reviewers based on changed paths
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Rules:
#   - Last matching pattern wins (put broad rules first, specific last)
#   - Owners: @username, @org/team, or email
#   - Teams must have Write+ access to count toward required reviews
#   - Enable: Settings → Branches → main → "Require review from Code Owners"

